  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "IPFIX: enable length calculation when only variable length fields are present",
  "description": "Change the computation of the minimum length to include the variable fields (which must be at least 1 octet). This means that the dissector can lookup the template and also that it can distinguish padding from a short record.\n\nFixes #20308",
