      "title": "IPFIX: Now can decode templates containing only variable fields",
      "message": "IPFIX: Now can decode templates containing only variable fields\n\nChange the computation of the minimum record length to include the variable\nfields (which must be at least 1 octet). This then enables the dissector to\nfind the template and also to distinguish it from padding.\n",
